  "title": "Chain Through a Hub",
  "caption": "The piece runs as one long chain from an old, fixed-wiring model of the brain down to a theory of consciousness, with a single hub in the middle — Spatial Computing theory — that branches sideways into two explanatory asides before the chain resumes.",
